ift links.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/reservations\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Reservations</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Venues guests can book through.</span></span></li></ul></section><section aria-labelledby=\"nav-media\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Media &amp; AI\"><p id=\"nav-media\" class=\"con-index__label\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Media &amp; AI</span></p><ul class=\"list list--plain con-index__list\"><li><a href=\"/admin/media\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Media</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Moderation queue, imports and duplicates.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/ai\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Media AI</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Captions, indexing and what the model may touch.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/concierge\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Concierge</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Answer traces, grounding failures, security alerts.</span></span></li></ul></section><section aria-labelledby=\"nav-operations\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Operations\"><p id=\"nav-operations\" class=\"con-index__label\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Operations</span></p><ul class=\"list list--plain con-index__list\"><li><a href=\"/admin/audit\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Audit trail</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Every action anyone took, searchable, redacted.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/jobs\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Jobs</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Queue depth, failures and retries.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/metrics\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Metrics</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">What this deployment recorded, and whether it is recording.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/providers\"><span data-bl-